= Instructions

Add @Bourbon{2 oz}, freshly squeezed @Lemon juice{3/4 oz}, @Simple syrup{1/2 oz} and @Egg white, optional {1/2 oz} 
to a #Cocktail shaker{} and dry-shake for ~{30 seconds} without ice.

Add @Ice{} and shake again for ~{15–20 seconds}, until well-chilled.

Strain into a #Rocks glass{} over fresh @Ice{}, or into a #Coupe glass{} without ice.

Garnish with @Angostura bitters{3-4 drops}.